Detection models
----------------
The two ONNX models the application downloads and runs are separate works with their own terms. They are
published as assets of the GitHub release "models-v1", not committed to this repository.

  person-yolo11n.onnx
    Ultralytics YOLO11n (stock COCO checkpoint, exported to ONNX at 1280 px). Copyright holder as named in the
    file's own metadata: Ultralytics. License: GNU AGPL-3.0 (https://ultralytics.com/license). Ultralytics also
    offers an Enterprise license for use that does not comply with the AGPL.

  osnet_x1_0_msmt17.onnx
    OSNet x1.0 person re-identification weights in the torchreid model-zoo family (torchreid code: MIT,
    https://github.com/KaiyangZhou/deep-person-reid), trained on the MSMT17 dataset. Research use: the MSMT17
    dataset terms could not be confirmed and the exact checkpoint is not independently confirmed. Check them
    before any commercial use.

See MODELS.md for provenance and checksums, and THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for every other component.
